e body used to it without wearing it out.","steps":["Warm-up: 10 min of easy walking, then ankle and hip circles","55 min of brisk walking (you can talk but not sing), 5 kg pack","Cool-down: 5 to 10 min of slow walking, then calf and thigh stretches"]}},{"name":"W7 · Two days back to back","week":7,"exercises":[],"cardio":{"sport":"hike","durationMin":420,"intensity":"Zone 1-2","purpose":"Put two days together to learn to set off again the next day, as on a trek.","steps":["Warm-up: 10 min of easy walking, then ankle and hip circles","4 h of hiking at a steady pace, 10 kg pack","The next day: 3 h of hiking, same pack (10 kg), easy pace","Cool-down: 5 to 10 min of slow walking, then calf and thigh stretches"],"notes":"Eat a little every hour and drink before you are thirsty. Before you go: route left with someone, weather checked, water, food, a warm layer, a first-aid kit and a charged phone."}},{"name":"W8 · Strength","week":8,"exercises":[{"exerciseName":"Goblet Squat","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"10-12","restSec":75},{"exerciseName":"Step-up","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"10-12","restSec":60},{"exerciseName":"Single-Leg Calf Raise","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"12-15","restSec":45},{"exerciseName":"Glute Bridge","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"12-15","restSec":45},{"exerciseName":"Side Plank","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"30s","restSec":45},{"exerciseName":"Bird Dog","targetSets":2,"targetReps":"10","restSec":45}]},{"name":"W8 · Brisk walk","week":8,"exercises":[],"cardio":{"sport":"hike","durationMin":45,"intensity":"Zone 2","purpose":"Walk at a good pace with a pack, to get the body used to it without wearing it out.","steps":["Warm-up: 10 min of easy walking, then ankle and hip circles","30 min of brisk walking (you can talk but not sing), 3 kg pack","Cool-down: 5 to 10 min of slow walking, then calf and thigh stretches"]}},{"name":"W8 · Easy outing","week":8,"exercises":[],"cardio":{"sport":"hike","durationMin":150,"intensity":"Zone 1-2","purpose":"Lighter week: th